# Browser "Save as PDF" from cv.html names the file after the page title, producing
# "CV — Tao Yun Huang · <version>.pdf" every time. One such export (the 2026-07-26
# Systems & Hardware one) still carried the B.Eng. and B.A. Drama that were never
# awarded, and it sat in this folder untracked until 2026-08-14. Ignore the whole
# shape so a stray re-export can never be committed by accident.
# The only CV that belongs in this folder is Tao_Yun_Huang_CV_Customer_Engineer.pdf.
CV —*.pdf

# Local safety copies taken before a large edit (e.g. index.html.bak-20260824).
# Useful on disk, never part of the site.
*.bak-*
